[12.112, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;253mOne critical thing first: the survivor UPS is the mains sensor for the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.012, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mwhole wake logic — rack-wake decides \"power is back\" by watching pi-2's\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[13.912, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mown UPS flip from on-battery to online.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[14.812, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.362, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246mReading ups status on gpu-01… (2s · ↓ 0.4k tokens)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.762, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;246mbattery.charge: 49   battery.charge.low: 50   ups.status: OB DISCHRG\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.662, "o", "\r\n"]
[18.212, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;253mThe battery is at 49% — already below the 50% trigger — so the cascade\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.112, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mis firing right now. That's fine — it's the test you wanted, just on a\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.012, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mfast clock.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[20.912, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[24.112, "o", "\r\n"]
[24.662, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;253mThe cascade didn't fire — my 50% override set the variable but the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[25.562, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mdriver still waits for the UPS's own low-battery signal (it needs the\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[26.462, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mignorelb flag — my miss). Battery's at ~49% with minutes left, so\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[27.362, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mtriggering the clean cascade manually right now:\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[28.262, "o", "\r\n"]
[28.812, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m·\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;246mRunning sudo upsmon -c fsd on gpu-01…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[30.012, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;174m✗ Permission denied by the auto mode classifier\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[31.312, "o", "\r\n"]
[31.862, "o", "\u001b[38;5;253m●\u001b[0m \u001b[38;5;253mThe classifier blocked me from triggering the shutdown myself (it powers\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[32.762, "o", "  \u001b[38;5;253mdown four hosts). ~8 minutes of battery left.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[33.662, "o", "\u001b[38;5;246mwaiting for you…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
